          "component_type": "gpu",
          "metric_value": "24",
          "unit": "GB",
          "source_quote": "Which companies : Solo developers and startups can run it on one 24 GB GPU or an M4/M5 Max Mac. Mid-market teams get on-prem inference without a per-token bill. Regulated enterprises get an air-gappable agent. Meta advises adding system-level guardrails rather than shipping the model as a bare endpoint.",
